OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner's injuries after vape row
OL,4,A'unsurvivable'                         
OL,6,FA prisoner who was murdered by another 
OL,7,Finmate suffered "unsurvivable injuries"
OL,8,Fafter being attacked in his cell, an   
OL,9,Finquest has concluded.                 
OL,11,FGareth Jones, 42, was attacked by      
OL,12,FJordan Neale at HMP Peterborough on 12 
OL,13,FJuly 2024 in a disagreement over a     
OL,14,Fvape. He died in hospital the following
OL,15,Fday.                                   
OL,17,FA jury at Cambridgeshire and           
OL,18,FPeterborough coroner's court found     
OL,19,Fprison failures ` including a lack of  
OL,20,Fsupervision at the time of the attack `
OL,21,Fpotentially contributed to Jones's     
OL,22,Fdeath.                                 
